From daa99a3041d5e276284dde48fe3958bc35eef340 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roland Haas <rhaas@tapir.caltech.edu>
Date: Wed, 31 Jul 2013 23:36:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] CarpetIOHDF5: support IO->alias option in reader

this allows the reader to read a dataset into a different variable than
which one was written. Eg. GRHydro::dens in PPAnalysis::dens.
---
 Carpet/CarpetIOHDF5/src/Input.cc                   |   33 +++++++++--
 Carpet/CarpetIOHDF5/test/alias_datasets.par        |   61 ++++++++++++++++++++
